{%- comment -%}
  Accessor of a child module: `Sensor` -> `sensor`, `Operator` -> `operatorModule`.
  Its member is the accessor followed by `_`. Parameter: name.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign accessor = name | lcfirst
  echo accessor
  if generator.reserved contains accessor
    echo 'Module'
  endif
-%}
